{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SACsteamBanner_Battle.png?t=1739772326\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat System</h2></strong><br>Exciting controls, diverse gameplay, cooperative multiplayer, and stunning combos!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SAC_GifSmiple2.gif?t=1739772326\" /><br><br>Master advanced techniques, a dazzling counterattack! A beautiful reversal!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SAC_GifSmiple1.gif?t=1739772326\" /><br><br>Super moves explode! Sweep the battlefield!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/Steamshop_PlayerEXShow.gif?t=1739772326\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SACsteamBanner_Boss.png?t=1739772326\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Formidable Challenges</h2></strong><br>Robot legions, orc space pirates, visitors from other dimensions, a variety of enemies lie in wait on your adventurous path!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/Steamshop_BossEXShow.gif?t=1739772326\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SACsteamBanner_Stroy.png?t=1739772326\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background</h2></strong><br>You will play as the interstellar ranger [Kelly] or the female combat robot [Muu(No.02)], defeating incoming competitors in search of the universe's ultimate treasure on planet AE-38, driving the ranger ship to ultimate victory!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/SACsteamBanner_Mission.png?t=1739772326\" /><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background</h2></strong><br>Distinctly styled planets, spaces filled with imagination for you to explore at will. Acquire new moves to make combat even more splendid, experience more fun with new equipment, spaceships, and helpers. Collect money, level up, become stronger!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3092360?t=1739772326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739772326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739772326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739772326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>FOLLOW US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow us for the latest info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/QQ.png?t=1739772326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/Twitter.png?t=1739772326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/Discord.png?t=1739772326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_par